  "title": "Celebrating Route 66: Photo Tips for Capturing “The Mother Road” on Its Centennial Anniversary",
  "summary": "Say the name “Route 66” and it conjures up dreams of following legendary authors, songwriters, and filmmakers down a road famously called “America’s Main Street.” I did just that, in a Volkswagen van filled with camping gear and film cameras, multiple times in the 1990s. Revisiting those photographs had me wanting to do it all […]",
